Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:47:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 349/443] [ae-patch] Add voice log to message: the last two
 minutes of voice events, for diagnosis

A phone's voice session fails in ways only the browser sees (mic start, refused playback, slow speech). The speaker menu now has a row that puts the last two minutes of voice events into the message box, so the user can send them to the agent; nothing leaves the device until sent.
